; v1.18: 05/17/03. Changes to dialogue display using new color codes.
; v1.19: 12/21/03. dialogue text spacing changes. Added Gold tax.
; v1.20. 12/05/04. Renamed Charm_Tax label to CTAX_CHARM-TAX.
;        Changed version from 1.19 to 1.20, 12/05/04.
; =================================================================
; 04/12/05: Added number identifier to the @else statements.
; 04/12/05:  changed version to 1.25.  Donald.
; 07/24/05: Added INSTALL and UNINSTALL sections to script.
; 05/31/07: v1.27: Revised Email/WWW info;  Changed version #.

